ow 5, and this perfectly matches the test input's expected output. I've also extracted and verified the relevant sub-matrix from the test input, confirming the pattern.\n\n**Sorting Columns by Frequency**\n\nI've confirmed the column reordering logic: the output columns are sorted based on the frequency of the value '6' within them, from lowest to highest count. I've applied this to the data, and the new column order for the output is established.\n\n**Reconstructing 13x14 Grid**\n\nI've successfully reconstructed the 13x14 grid by applying the discovered column ordering logic based on the frequency of '6'. My current focus is on accurately replicating the even and odd rows based on the observed patterns and the new column order.\n\n",
